  "implementation": "Reuse public OpenNURBS IsPlanar on an owned exact NURBS transfer for the oriented supporting plane, including line and closed winding conventions. For spatial curves reuse the Rust rotation-minimizing frame integrator with world-Z cross initial tangent seed and deterministic vertical fallback. Recompute on a reversed guide for Flip; map the base CPlane or original OnCurve frame into the destination frame. Preview and commits share this source-only placement solver. Reuse the existing bounded screen-space curve picker and shared transformed-object history renewal, copy preferences, and history grouping.",
