  "native_capture_note": "The successful comparisons use the two final captures. The initial discovery has three canceled commands caused by an extra Enter after curve selection. The intermediate placement capture has one canceled rotation caused by incorrect angle/target ordering. Keep those rejected setup diagnostics and the 25-case frame discovery as historical evidence; they do not contribute to the 49-case comparison. The probe evolved during discovery, so the current helper digest is a reproducer fingerprint, not proof of byte identity of earlier staged helpers. SDK FrameAt/PerpendicularFrameAt/plane outputs are diagnostic only. Fixture alias front explicitly uses Plane.WorldZX and right uses Plane.WorldYZ.",
  "local_history_note": "Exactly identity initial-z-0 adds no local undo entry; the other 48 direct placements do. Repeated interactive copies form one external history entry. Accepted copies survive cancellation; cancellation before placement adds no geometry history. Native undo was not captured.",
  "limitations": [
    "SubCrv guide selection is not supported.",
    "The guide itself cannot be included among sources.",
    "The fixtures do not establish behavior at all self-intersections, singularities, near-planar boundaries, or arbitrarily complex rational curves.",
